OL,9,     Fdisaster for Marta. Scott races to
OL,10,     Frecover a damaged trailer before
OL,11,     Fdark descends.
OL,12,G0300 Trucking Hell
OL,13,     FJim must rescue a 32-tonne truck
OL,14,     Ffrom a soft dirt embankment. Marta
OL,15,     Fis driven around the bend trying
OL,16,     Fto deliver a 48-foot articulated
OL,17,     Fbus.
